```rust
// In some library module file
lazy_static! {
    static ref REGISTRY: Mutex<Vec<String>> = {
        let m = Mutex::new(Vec::new());
        // Side-effect executed automatically on module load/import
        println!("Initializing connection to external socket...");
        m
    };
}
```

fix:
Expose an explicit, manual initialization function that the application must call at its startup.
```rust
pub fn init_services() -> Result<(), Error> {
    println!("Initializing connection...");
    Ok(())
}
